host Vultr SEA NixOS VPS ai-jail pier (Daylight DC-1 hand) -- Eastern (EDT)
title The path a run leaves a reply on, written once for the whole ladder
prompt Autonomous loop -- continue the Caravan ladder lift Lindy-first crux-first, Standfast on reds first, send each finished increment as its own signed round
think Standfast came first and it fired. Opening the next family forced the realized-fall subtraction by hand, and 27 x (27 - 3) = 648 only matches the queue's printed number if a delegating stub is three lines -- which is exactly what the round an hour earlier had denied in its own record. Reading `caravan/abate.rye` settled it in one command: signature, return statement, closing brace.
think Booked and closed that as REDS %128 before touching new code. The living surfaces -- `crux/REMEMBER.md` and the `session-logs/README.md` index row -- were corrected in place; the dated log kept its wrong obs line and gained an obs ERRATUM line beneath it, because a log records a belief and a correction sits beside it rather than over it. Adding the row moved the spine to 128, so the ledger's headline went RED on all three recited numbers and was corrected to what its own guard measures off disk.
think Chose `press_path` over the two families that return more, and the choice is Lindy-first rather than arithmetic. `renew_path` returns about 720 and `ask_path` about 660, and both stand private in all thirty-one rungs, so either would widen thirty-one declarations before it paid. `press_path` returns 648 and widens nothing.
think Hashed all twenty-eight bodies before the meter, as the arc's own teaching asks. One hash, twenty-seven lines, no odd rung -- no rung's own subject is the reply path, so none had cause to differ. Then checked the four contract symbols the lifted body reaches through the caller: `max_note_path_len`, `NoteError`, `addressable`, and `reader_dir` each already public in all twenty-eight.
think Measured the next queue rather than reciting it. A script read every family's largest hash group, its line count, its signature length, its publicity, and its variant count, so the printed order is realized fall -- copies minus one times lines minus stub -- rather than carried lines. That reordering is what put `bearing_published` at the head that widens nothing, and it surfaced that `choose_pass` carries nine variant bodies beside its family.
obs Prediction met measurement to the digit for the sixth lap running. Carry 78,265 to 77,617, delegates 2,736 to 2,764 -- exactly the twenty-eight stubs -- families holding at 705, bodies 18,160 over 7,956 distinct.
obs The stub-cost formula is written into the witness prose this lap rather than left in a reader's head. REDS %128 happened because the one quantity in the round that a hand typed from a glance was the one quantity that was wrong; every number a meter printed was right. A formula printed beside the queue is a formula the next lap cannot mistype.
obs The widening question now orders the queue more than the line count does. Three of the top five families return more than the head this lap chose, and each would open a seam across thirty-one rungs. The queue is honestly a two-key sort: fall, then whether the fold widens.
loom witness=caravan_ladder_carry carried=77617 ceiling=77623 fall=648 delegates=2764 modules=110 bodies=18160 distinct=7956 families=705
loom witness=caravan_suite rungs=107 verdict=GREEN
