file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh the carry ceiling brought down to 77623
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish the measured carry and a fold queue reordered by realized fall, with the stub-cost formula printed beside it
file crux/REDS.md REDS %128 booked and closed, and the headline corrected to the spine the monotone guard measures
file crux/REMEMBER.md Now refilled with this lift, prior edges condensed to one line, next crux named by realized fall and by whether it widens
recommend keep-going bearing_published at thirty-nine rungs by twenty lines -- about 646 by realized fall, public in every one, no odd rung among them, so it is the head that widens nothing while renew_path and ask_path each want thirty-one declarations opened first
